=== star unpacking two starred
def f(a: list[int], b: list[int]) -> list[int]:
    return [*a, *b]
---
Concat(a, b)
---

=== star unpacking starred then element
def f(xs: list[int], y: int) -> list[int]:
    return [*xs, y]
---
Concat(xs, [y])
---

=== star unpacking element then starred
def f(x: int, rest: list[int]) -> list[int]:
    return [x, *rest]
---
Concat([x], rest)
---

=== star unpacking element starred element
def f(x: int, middle: list[int], y: int) -> list[int]:
    return [x, *middle, y]
---
Concat(Concat([x], middle), [y])
---

